<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marine Drilling raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marine Drilling raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies &amp; Co analyst Roderick McKenzie raised his rating on shares of Marine Drilling Cos Inc to buy from accumulate due to results from two new deep water drilling units.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.15 from $1.05 and fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $1.65 from $1.54.</p>
<p>-- Marine Drilling shares were up 1/2 at 23-1/4 by mid-morning.</p>
</text>
